  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Digital Solutions to Improve Horticultural Crop Management in the Caribbean</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To implement and pilot the use low-cost digital solutions with practical applicability to improve crop management and productivity, increasing yield.
To support the application of required inputs precisely and improving advisory services in collaboration with private sector to achieve adaptation to small-scale farmers and academia.
To validate and test innovative technologies as well as to support governments in providing the enabling environment for sustainability.</narrative>
  </description>
